The legal text is the Constitución Política de la República de Guatemala as published by the Corte de
Constitucionalidad de Guatemala (https://www.cc.gob.gt/index.php/constitucion-politica/), 2024 edition, read on
29 October 2026. The page carries no licence statement. The text is reproduced as an official publication of the
Court, with attribution to it. The Court's robots.txt allows search and reference use and asks that content not be
used to train AI models. This repository is a reference text.

The Código de Trabajo is the Oficina Nacional de Servicio Civil edition published on the website of the Autoridad
para el Manejo Sustentable de la Cuenca y del Lago de Amatitlán (amsclae.gob.gt). The Código Procesal Penal is the
edition of the Centro Nacional de Análisis y Documentación Judicial (CENADOJ) of the Organismo Judicial, updated to
30 April 2014, whose imprint reads "Derechos reservados: Organismo Judicial de Guatemala"; only the text of the law is
reproduced here, without the editor's notes, presentation or annex. Both are reproduced as official legal texts, with
attribution to the bodies that published them.

The arrangement of this repository, its tables, commit messages and tools are by Lexifina and may be
reused under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). This repository is not legal advice and not an official
publication.
